Package: kelpbioshiny
Title: Shiny App for Bayesian Kelp Biomass Estimation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seb", "Dalgarno", , "seb@poissonconsulting.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3658-4517")),
    person("Tula Foundation", role = c("fnd", "cph")))
Description: A 'shiny' app for annual estimates of kelp biomass by site with
    the 'kelpbio' package. It steps through loading survey data, fitting or
    choosing pre-fit sub-models, checking their diagnostics, and exporting the
    biomass estimates.
